    # "L拿着一盒国际象棋走进了囚室，月明显注意到了，他的目光在棋盒上黏了几秒，然后又转回L。"
    "L walked into the cell holding a chess set. Light clearly noticed; his gaze lingered on the chess box for a few seconds before turning back to L."
# game/script/chess.rpy:9
translate english play_chess_a4e30629:
    # "月的目光带着期待。"
    "Light's gaze was filled with anticipation."
# game/script/chess.rpy:11
translate english play_chess_a5abcdb4:
    # Y "终于有些有趣的东西了吗？这里的生活确实太无聊了。"
    Y "Finally, something interesting? Life here is really boring."
# game/script/chess.rpy:13
translate english play_chess_c30eebc5:
    # "L点头回应。"
    "L nodded in response."
# game/script/chess.rpy:17
translate english play_chess_4b261925:
    # "月的目光充满嘲讽之意。"
    "Light looked on with sarcasm. "
# game/script/chess.rpy:19
translate english play_chess_09372bdc:
    # Y "大侦探也会关心囚犯的心理健康吗？"
    Y "Does the great detective also care about the mental health of prisoners?"
# game/script/chess.rpy:21
translate english play_chess_9bace6af:
    # "L无视了这句话。"
    "L ignored this remark."
# game/script/chess.rpy:22
translate english play_chess_902baa52:
    # L order2 "我确实注意到了夜神君最近的压力指数有些高，下棋是很好的放松方式，和我对弈也许可以缓解你的无聊。"
    L order2 "I did notice that Yagami-kun's stress level has been a bit high lately. Playing chess is a great way to relax, and playing against me might ease your boredom."
# game/script/chess.rpy:24
translate english play_chess_5c82407b:
    # Y "听上去不错，但是我现在这样要怎么下棋？"
    Y "That sounds good, but how am I supposed to play chess like this?"
# game/script/chess.rpy:26
translate english play_chess_a76352c5:
    # L "每次下棋的时候我会解开你的镣铐，如果夜神君试图袭击我或者逃走，这项活动会被永久取消。"
    L "I will unlock your shackles every time we play chess. If Yagami-kun tries to attack me or escape, this activity will be permanently canceled."
# game/script/chess.rpy:28
translate english play_chess_fb69d467:
    # Y "我知道我无处可去，不用废话了。"
    Y "I know I have nowhere to go. Stop with the nonsense."
# game/script/chess.rpy:30
translate english play_chess_f86e5ddf:
    # "L取出钥匙，解开了月的手铐和脚铐。月活动着手腕和脚腕，他真是受够被铐住的日子了。"
    "L took out the key and unlocked Light's handcuffs and ankle cuffs. Light moved his wrists and ankles—he was really tired of being shackled."
# game/script/chess.rpy:30
translate english play_chess_a55cf477:
    # "然后L打开棋盒，棋盒展开之后自然就是一副棋盘，棋子整齐地码放其中。"
    "Then L opened the chess box; when unfolded, it naturally became a chessboard, with the pieces neatly arranged inside."
# game/script/chess.rpy:34
translate english play_chess_729349fe:
    # L pt "我执黑棋吧。"
    L pt "I'll play with the black pieces."
# game/script/chess.rpy:36
translate english play_chess_bed11925:
    # Y smile2 "你还真是好心，知道让让我。"
    Y smile2 "You're really kind to let me have the white pieces."
# game/script/chess.rpy:38
translate english play_chess_71447501:
    # "夜神月哼笑了一声。"
    "Light Yagami let out a snort of laughter."
# game/script/chess.rpy:38
translate english play_chess_71af1251:
    # "他们把囚室里唯一的一套桌椅搬到床对面，L抛弃了一看就很硬的椅子，蹲到了月的床上，月只能在椅子上落座。"
    "They moved the only set of table and chairs in the cell to the opposite side of the bed. L abandoned the chair that looked stiff, squatted on Light's bed, and Light had no choice but to sit on the chair."
# game/script/chess.rpy:44
translate english play_chess_bae33a91:
    # "这是你们第[chess_play_count]次下棋。"
    "This is your [chess_play_count]th time playing chess together."
# game/script/chess.rpy:45
translate english play_chess_7c1ecadd:
    # L smile2 "夜神君似乎很期待和我下棋的游戏呢。"
    L smile2 "Yagami-kun seems to be looking forward to playing chess with me."
# game/script/chess.rpy:46
translate english play_chess_8e75c43a:
    # Y "那是因为只有在这个时候，我才有机会打败你。"
    Y "That's because this is the only time I have a chance to beat you."
# game/script/chess.rpy:47
translate english play_chess_a0956dca:
    # L unhappy "真是可怕的胜负欲。"
    L unhappy "What a terrifying desire to win."
# game/script/chess.rpy:48
translate english play_chess_9b2c8ba7:
    # Y "别说得你自己不想赢一样。"
    Y "Don't act like you don't want to win yourself."
# game/script/chess.rpy:49
translate english play_chess_d733f8b6:
    # Y "别废话了，开始吧。"
    Y "Enough talk. Let's start."
# game/script/chess.rpy:57
translate english play_chess_5d71d274:
    # Y "势均力敌……下次我一定会赢。"
    Y "It's evenly matched... I will definitely win next time."
# game/script/chess.rpy:58
translate english play_chess_f535a228:
    # L smile1 "那就让我期待下一局的结果吧。"
    L smile1 "Then I'll look forward to the result of our next game."
# game/script/chess.rpy:62
translate english play_chess_fc025ef0:
    # Y "……"
    Y "..."
# game/script/chess.rpy:63
translate english play_chess_d51bcb56:
    # "月盯着棋盘，似乎在分析自己哪里出错了。"
    "Light stared at the chessboard, seemingly analyzing where he went wrong."
# game/script/chess.rpy:65
translate english play_chess_d9beab90:
    # Y "哼……今天不过是你运气好而已。"
    Y "Hmph... You just got lucky today."
# game/script/chess.rpy:66
translate english play_chess_ce159342:
    # L "夜神君，有时候坦然地面对自己的失败比较好哦。"
    L "Yagami-kun, sometimes it's better to face your failures calmly."
# game/script/chess.rpy:67
