    Y deyi "What's wrong? Not in good form today?"
# game/script/chess.rpy:73
translate english play_chess_15a22f2c:
    # "L撇嘴，不理会月假惺惺的安慰。"
    "L frowned and ignored Light's insincere consolation."
# game/script/chess.rpy:74
translate english play_chess_558a0bef:
    # L unhappy "只是输了一次而已，下一局我会认真的。"
    L unhappy "I only lost once. I'll take the next game seriously."
